# PRODUCTION since 2026-11-25. Agents/coding: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, routed experts of all 40 layers in pinned RAM (dio)
# plus expert prefetch (needs a build with patches/patch-prefetch-port.diff; without the variable it behaves like stock).
# Prefill 4k/16k/64k/120k: 2384/2438/2051/1696 t/s, vs. 1408/1402/1241 with profile "coding". Output bit-identical
# to the same build without prefetch.
# Cost: ~22 GiB RAM permanently bound (dio) + ~1 GB for the vision projector; +630 MiB VRAM (3 prefetch slots),
# ~0.4 GB VRAM left at 128k.
# Data: data/prefill-ueberlappung-20261125/. Rollback: profile coding.
GGML_SCHED_PREFETCH_EXPERTS=3
# Sampling: Qwen3.6 model card, "thinking mode for precise coding" (the sampling post). Server default for clients that send none.
LLAMA_ARGS=-m /path/to/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf --alias qwen3.6-35b-a3b-pf -ngl 99 -ncmoe 40 -fa on -t 10 -b 4096 -ub 4096 -c 131072 -np 1 --fit off --cache-ram 4096 --load-mode dio --mmproj /path/to/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-mmproj-F16.gguf --no-mmproj-offload --temp 0.6 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0 --presence-penalty 0.0 --repeat-penalty 1.0
